      "path": "cordis.patch.yml",
      "text": "# Bundle layer for Ratel Lumina.\n#\n# The `id` is the Cordis plugin identity; it MUST match the `name` export of\n# lib/index.js (the host half). The `name` is the npm package name, which the\n# loader resolves through Node so the installed code is found.\n#\n# Loaded after every earlier bundle in the profile's `dsh.profile.bundles`\n# list, so a later layer wins per row.\n- insert:\n    - id: ui-lumina\n      name: \"@ratel-works/dsh-lumina\"\n"
    }
  ],
